markdownFiles() classifies agent-definition candidates with
Dirent.isFile(), which is false for symlinks. Home-manager renders
~/.pi/agent/agents/<name>.md as symlinks, so every user-layer fleet
definition was silently skipped and rosters degraded to the bundled
definitions. Follow symlinks via stat(); dangling links are skipped.

